WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.920
There's been this press and this talk

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.130
that you participated, you're
in the bloodiest scene,

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.150
they're calling it the bloodiest scene

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.350
in the history of horror films.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:11.090
And I think they have actual statistics

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:12.720
to back it up in this next film

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:13.600
is that true?

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.900
That's what I was told on set,

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.522
it wasn't real blood, obviously.

00:00:18.522 --> 00:00:19.355
(laughter)

00:00:19.355 --> 00:00:21.690
What if it was real blood,

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:24.813
and it was an incredible
waste of precious human blood.

00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:25.646
Yeah, yeah, oh yeah.

00:00:25.646 --> 00:00:27.915
Nine hospitals had no blood.

00:00:27.915 --> 00:00:28.748
(Jessica laughing)

00:00:28.748 --> 00:00:29.690
But they said it was worth it.

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:30.523
Yeah yeah.

00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:32.230
That's why you shoot in Canada.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:33.438
For my art.

00:00:33.438 --> 00:00:34.271
(all laughing)

00:00:34.271 --> 00:00:35.104
They're like,

00:00:35.104 --> 00:00:38.385
well they needed blood
for their movie I guess.

00:00:38.385 --> 00:00:39.218
(all laughing)

00:00:39.218 --> 00:00:40.070
Can't help ya sorry.

00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:41.420
Yeah sorry, I'm so sorry.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:43.510
You're grandmas gonna go.

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:45.946
So wait so you were, it's
fake blood yes, but--

00:00:45.946 --> 00:00:49.916
It's fake blood, it's 4500
gallons of fake blood.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:50.749
(audience member cheers)

00:00:50.749 --> 00:00:52.314
Right, woo!

00:00:52.314 --> 00:00:53.610
(audience claps)

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:54.830
And that means that you are,

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:56.890
like you're whole, you're in it,

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.080
you're immersed in blood.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.630
I was immersed in it,

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:02.240
I mean basically it's
kind of like a mixture

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.690
it's like KY jelly with red dye.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:06.920
Oh (chuckles) well,

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.103
I've been there.

00:01:08.103 --> 00:01:10.436
(all laugh)

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:12.895
Anyway.

00:01:12.895 --> 00:01:15.145
(laughing)

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.579
Settle down, it's not that kind of show.

00:01:20.579 --> 00:01:22.540
But, but you said,

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.030
you encouraged the director
go for it, you said--

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:26.040
I did.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:27.570
Pour as much blood as
you got to, go for it.

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:29.450
Well, he said you know,

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:31.120
he was telling me about
the scene and he said,

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:32.670
you know its only gonna
go up to your chest,

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:34.350
and it's fine and I said,

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:37.240
well this is our opportunity to really

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.380
make something crazy,

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:40.290
let's do Carrie on steroids.

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:41.123
Right.

00:01:41.123 --> 00:01:43.690
So I fully went in the blood,

00:01:43.690 --> 00:01:46.764
which I regretted a lot afterwards.

00:01:46.764 --> 00:01:48.070
Yeah.

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:50.437
I was pulling stuff out of
my eyeballs the next day.

00:01:50.437 --> 00:01:51.280
Right, right.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:52.500
That could have been your eyeball,

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.180
you don't know, what with
so much blood around.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.160
Is it true that you do an impression

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.970
of Jessica covered in the blood?

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.170
Yeah.

00:01:59.170 --> 00:02:01.530
And set up this impression for me.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:02.363
Oh man--

00:02:02.363 --> 00:02:03.196
Yeah.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:06.310
Ah, you want an impression, buddy?

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.000
I'll get it for you.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.208
Ah you want a Jessica
Chastain in blood, huh.

00:02:09.208 --> 00:02:11.410
I'm gonna put a nickel in and there ya go.

00:02:11.410 --> 00:02:12.938
All right, Jessica Chastain in blood.

00:02:12.938 --> 00:02:14.450
(all laugh)

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.080
No what happened was when they would

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:18.320
pour the blood on Jessica,

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.350
it was incredibly cold,

00:02:20.350 --> 00:02:23.900
and so when that happened
we knew that was our time,

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:26.070
that we were about to shoot any minute,

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:28.114
so we would hear this sound which was

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:29.762
(theatrical shivering sound)

00:02:29.762 --> 00:02:31.001
(all laugh)

00:02:31.001 --> 00:02:31.834
And then we would be like,

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:36.209
oh all right, here we go, all right.

00:02:36.209 --> 00:02:38.503
She's like all right, let's
go let's go go go go go go go.

